WEBVTT

NOTE RJ Tech bilingual subtitles — Chinese above, English below.

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:13.800
将新的电池线束总成放入电池仓，并对齐五个固定点。
Place the new battery harness assembly in the compartment and align its five mounting points.

2
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.500
确认 1、2、3、4、5 五个点位全部对齐。
Confirm that mounting points 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 are aligned.

3
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.700
装上 M6 螺母并均匀打紧。
Install the M6 nuts and tighten them evenly.

4
00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:46.460
安装 VCU 和 DC 总成组合支架。
Install the combined VCU and DC assembly bracket.

5
00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:54.760
将线束上的 VCU 接插件与对应接口连接。
Connect the harness VCU plug to its matching interface.

6
00:00:58.633 --> 00:01:02.833
连接其余 VCU 接插件。
Connect the remaining VCU plug.

7
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:06.033
连接 DC 总成接插件。
Connect the DC assembly plug.

8
00:01:09.488 --> 00:01:13.488
用卡扣和扎带固定线束。
Secure the harness with the specified clips and ties.

9
00:01:32.165 --> 00:01:35.018
将总成安装到电池仓体上。
Mount the assembly to the battery compartment.

10
00:01:40.252 --> 00:01:42.545
仓体上有两个固定点。
The compartment has two mounting points.

11
00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:49.925
用 M6 螺母紧固这两个固定点。
Secure both mounting points with M6 nuts.

12
00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:03.735
整理 DR 线束。
Arrange the DR harness.

13
00:02:06.235 --> 00:02:14.935
按照视频所示路径布置 DR 线束。
Route the DR harness along the path shown in the video.

14
00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:20.335
将所有卡扣压入对应固定孔位。
Lock every clip into its assigned mounting hole.
